  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve the highest accuracy (0.6530), but the impact of aggregation methods (avgpool vs. transformer) on pca_n2000 remains untested. This experiment tests transformer aggregation with pca_n2000 in a multiprofile RNA-only setup, isolating the effect of aggregation. It clarifies whether transformer aggregation's benefits (observed in config_006) generalize across RNA encoders, providing critical insight into design choices under limited budget."
